        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronaldinho, Samuel Eto'o, Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Christopher Lambert, Mike Tyson, Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson\n- Awards: FIFA World Player of the Year, Ballon d'Or\n- Films: Kickboxer: Retaliation\n- Topics: Football honors, film cast\n\nFacts:\n- Ronaldinho won two FIFA World Player of the Year awards and one Ballon d'Or, and he is often considered one of the best players of his generation and one of the greatest footballers of all time.\n- In 2005, Ronaldinho was named FIFA World Player of the Year for the second consecutive time with the highest points total ever.\n- In 2005, Samuel Eto'o finished third in the FIFA World Player of the Year voting.\n- Kickboxer: Retaliation stars Alain Moussi, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Christopher Lambert, Ronaldinho, Mike Tyson, and Hafþór Júlíus Björnsson.",
